Rattle did not seek another test. Despite his test results, just knowing that the vaccine is likely to increase his antibodies again is enough to reassure him: “I believe the vaccine is effective.”
Dr. Fauci acknowledged that such tests are suitable for individuals, but do not recommend that people use them to determine when a booster of vaccine is needed. “If I go to LabCorp or one of the places and say,’I want to get the level of anti-spike antibodies,’ if I want to, I can tell what my level is,” he said in an interview.
Dr. Fauci said that if COVID-19 booster injections become necessary, we may obtain them from our usual healthcare providers on a standard schedule based on your age, underlying health and other vaccine schedules. “You don’t have to take blood tests for everyone ,” said Dr. Fauci.
