Bookmakers offer welcome bonuses in two main formats: first deposit bonus with rollover or first free bet in the form of free bets.
• Cash bonus : The amount of money that is credited to the player's gaming account at the bookmaker. Example: a user makes a deposit of 100 euros, the bookmaker offers a 100% cash bonus to all new users up to 100 euros.
A free bet bonus differs from a cash bonus in that it is not money itself. This money becomes part of your account only after you win a bet.
