The Random Number Generator is a digital chip that randomly selects numbers (from zero to billion). Using special formulas, the Random Number Generator converts the numbers in all understandable symbols of slot machines, which subsequently appear and are visualized on the screen of your mobile phone or computer.
As soon as the player presses the "start" button, the Random Number Generator produces a certain result. In the meantime, the game reels spin on your computer screen and give the impression that the outcome of the game has not yet been decided.
Only luck and the mechanics of the Random Number Generator determine whether you are the winner, get the big win or leave all the money to the casino owners!
Myth one: RNG is a microprocessor that follows a given cycle over and over.
