Switch refers to an electronic component that can open a circuit, interrupt current or make it flow to other circuits.
A sensor is a detection device that can sense the measured information and can output, transmit, process, store, display, record and control the felt information.
Radio frequency (RF) is the electromagnetic frequency that can be radiated into space.
A resistor, which is a current-limiting element, has a fixed resistance, usually two pins, that limits the amount of current flowing through the branch to which it is connected.
A tool is a tool used for work.
wire, cable is used for electric power, electrical and related transmission purposes of the material, usually the number of cores, small diameter, simple structure called wire, other called cable.
