Drive to Denmark in the morning and come home married in the evening. The marriage is recognized WORLDWIDE and you will receive an 5-language marriage certificate immediately after the wedding ceremony.
Branch Spain (calls from Spain and South America)
Postal address: Express Wedding, Valby Langgade 127, DK-2500 Valby / Copenhagen, Denmark
IMMEDIATELY MARRIED in 1-10 DAYS
Send us your documents by e-mail in order as PDF files. Each document must be in a PDF file and be color copies.
The processing time takes about 5 working days at the Danish authorities. Thereafter, a Danish certificate of marital status is issued, which must be submitted to the registry office.
Your ORIGINAL documents must be brought along and presented on the day of the wedding, together with your valid ID / passport (and possibly residence permit).
We offer not only civil marriages in the registry office, but also on the beach, in the lighthouse, on a castle, on horseback, in the Tivoli, in the beautiful garden or in the hotel. You decide yourself where you would like to marry.
The agency Express Weddiv SL arranges a marriage date in Denmark for couples who have decided to get married. This paid service includes the following:
The client will be notified by the agency as soon as all necessary documents and payment have arrived. Timely delivery of all documents and complete completion of the marriage declaration and the order form are required for processing the order.
In order to be able to conclude the marriage, the client incurs additional costs, such as the journey to the registry office, fees at the civil registry office (if these have not been paid in advance) and, where appropriate, interpreters, accommodation and meals.
Express Weddiv SL shall not be liable for any marriages that have not been carried out due to false information, late-filed papers, late registration with the registry office, late appearance on the marriage date, missing or falsified original documents or reasons that lie in the person of the client ,
The agency assumes no responsibility in the event of force majeure (eg in the event of a breakdown of trains, ferries, aircraft or illness, death, war, terrorism, strikes or meteorological disabilities). If the marriage is not due to force majeure, there will be no refund of the service charge.
In accordance with §28 BDSG (Federal Data Protection Act) we draw your attention to the fact that the data required in the course of business processing are processed and stored by means of a computer system in accordance with § 33 BDSG. All personal data collected by the customer will be treated confidentially.
The seat of Express Weddiv SL is Betera / ES. The contracting parties agree on the application of the law of Betera / ES with regard to all legal relationships arising from this contractual relationship.
