How about the present, future & answers?
In the past, people did not have a clear understanding of power consumption and cost, and adopted a relatively extensive economic development. After learning a lot of lessons, the data center builders began to realize the disadvantages of unreasonable energy consumption and took corresponding measures to change it.
The base value of PUE is 2, which means that the 1W power consumption of chip-level master device will cause the total power consumption of 2W. Currently, the PUE value of advanced data centers is usually below 2, while the average PUE value of data centers in China is between 2.2 and 3.0.
There is no doubt that the chip is the key factor of the data center product, especially on the high-speed chip. In the research of 400G optical transceiver, people often hesitate on the technological path—DSP or CDR?
For example, some data centers must be built in the humid and hot south China area, such climatic conditions are not conducive to heat dissipation, it will be another challenge that how to get low PUE values and optimized TCO in such areas which the data center must face.
The above is the analysis of power loss and some of the current schemes, although they are not yet completely systematic and scientific, but people have begun to act. On the construction of the data center project, more questions must be asked:
For the chief financial officer: how much will it cost to build a data center?
How to reduce the budget as much as possible?
