If you sign up for Hodl Hodl through our link you will receive an interesting discount on each anonymous bitcoin purchase transaction. To create an account on Hodlhodl.com you only need to provide the following information:
Your time zone.
Once everything has been provided, a confirmation email will be sent to the address provided. After clicking the confirmation link in your email address, you will be redirected to their website to log into your account.
This includes your location, where you can choose to buy BTC from people with the same location as you. If the location of the seller is not that important to you, just leave the "Include global offers" box checked.
Once the type of payment has been chosen, the payment method will show the available methods depending on the type chosen. If the type of payment is not a problem for you, just choose "No value" so that all payment methods are displayed.
Selling BTC on Hodlhodl.com is, in general, similar to the process of buying them. Instead of searching for payment methods for yourself, The challenge now is to find payment methods with which buyers feel comfortable because you are the one who sells BTC.
