3 Types of traders - Classification of cryptocurrency, Forex or stock traders
Especially in thetrading short-medium term. Today there is traders who invest in the stock market, Forex or crypto as a pure hobby, while having a coffee in a break from work, and there are also traders who live from investing full time, either from home or from a specialized firm such as a management company.
