How long will thetraderholding your open position?
Enter and exit fleetingly. If you do not have enough knowledge, scalping is the fastest way to lose all your money with the stock market or cryptocurrencies.
It is not strange that ascalpersoccasionally becomes a daytrader and decide to wait hours to close your position due to a certain prediction based on technical analysis that will allow you to obtain higher profits.
Eltrader Short-term holds his position for several days or weeks. With a somewhat more flexible classification, traders who do swing trading They are characterized by being exposed longer than scalpers.
