2 Solana: why is she different
The cryptocurrency Solana reaches an all-time high price
Solana comprises a system of 200 nodes that support significant performance and a consensus method called proof-of-history.
One of the main distinguishing features of Solana is its proof of history consensus mechanism for adding new transactions to the blockchain, which demonstrates that a certain event occurred at a specific time without the need for validators to talk to each other to agree on the moment. According to the founder and CEO of the project, Anatoly Yakovlenko, this allows for greater speed and safety.
