According to DappRadar, the game is becoming very popular in developing countries such as Brazil, India, Indonesia, the Philippines and Venezuela.
To get Axie Infinity scholarships in 2021, it is best to visit one of the many existing Facebook groups dedicated to the game and apply. You can also try it in forums.
Through the scholarship program, people have access to Axies without actually owning them. They will earn an income share on their SLP earnings.
This means that at current rates, as mentioned above, raising a virgin Axie costs $ 80 on AXS and $ 60 on SLP. When SLP is very expensive, rearing costs go up exponentially.
