Binamon aspires to become the jewel that the world of cryptocurrencies and games to make money have been waiting for. A new earn-to-play that combines the possibility of making big profits but without detracting from the quality (something that cannot be said about games like Alien Worlds o Crypto Blades).
As with Dragonary, Binamon will have starter packs to start playing with a certain advantage and rarer monsters.
Element: The element endows the Binamon with unique qualities. We currently have 6 possible elements: Forest, Water, Fire, Light, Phisic and Quantum.
Important: In order to empower a monster with energy, it is necessary that that energy be of the same element and of the same class. In this way, the rarer Binamons will need rarer energies to empower them.
As with monsters, there is the same rarity algorithm, however there are only two energy stats: Element and Class.
In Binamon, Each monster is destroyed using a certain combination of elements. When a monster dies the player receives a reward, and these rewards can be exchanged for real money, so players will earn better and more rewards as they progress through the game.
Farms are systems where holders will be rewarded for having certain types of tokens. To do this, rewards are defined, which are given to everyone based on the amount of tokens they contribute to the reward pool (farms).
In many cases you will need to create an LP. An LP is a token that is created in Pancakeswap and for this you have to provide liquidity.
There are farms with a LP limit that can be contributed per account, so we let everyone win!
