Scalping is the form of trading that requires a greater mastery not only of technique, but also of psychology. Characterized by performing very fast operations (and unthinkable in the days before the internet), scalpers operate in a matter of minutes or seconds.
El trader expert in scalping uses candlestick or 1-2 minute charts, aided by a deep web of indicators, oscillators, and you know how to close deals quickly and as soon as you have reached your pre-planned profit or loss point target.
