Die Change in Less than 30 Seconds.
INSERTED PIECE ASSEMBLY ROTARY DIE is a quick die change cylinder that fits right into your existing machinery and workflow. We built it to help all kinds of companies speed up production while increasing safety and quality.
INSERTED PIECE ASSEMBLY ROTARY DIE is the most advanced quick-change rotary die cutting cylinder on the market. It dramatically increases production output of die cutting machines and always produces high-quality cuts.
The die then slides to expel air for a secure fit, and SERRAPID’s durable springs hold the die in place with a uniform force of 1000 N (220 lbs). Inserted piece assembly rotary die unique fastening system creates even pressure on all parts of the die, and forms a smooth outer surface that prevents wear and tear on machine parts.
Boost Productivity. Inserted piece assembly rotary die reduces total setup time by 5 to 15 minutes and dramatically increases production levels.
Protect Your Existing Investments. Inserted piece assembly rotary die is Installable on all rotary die cutters on the market, and can even make dies of different RDC brands interchangeable.
Get Teams Trained Fast. Onsite safety and product training at the time of installation prepares your team to work with Inserted piece assembly rotary die efficiently from day one.
Inserted piece assembly rotary die adapter allows you to quickly integrate your existing dies with the Inserted piece assembly rotary die . It eliminates all error from the conversion process and works with all brands of machines.
